  "description": "The meme's implication that Black people are 'underwater divers' taps into a broader societal pattern of racialized assumptions about physical competence, particularly in water. This stereotype can be part of a larger narrative that exoticizes or mocks Black people's physical abilities, which is considered harmful in context.",
